method.description:
Parses the given YAML string and returns the corresponding [Variant] (usually a [Dictionary] or [Array]).
Returns [code]null[/code] if the YAML is invalid. An error message is printed to the console.
[codeblock]
var result = YAML.parse_string("key: value")
if result == null:
    push_error("Failed to parse YAML")
else:
    print(result.key)  # "value"
[/codeblock]
